      <p source="#source-250-285"><seg source="#source-250-285">われながく憂ひに栖みて</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-285-325"><seg source="#source-285-325">はやく身は老いんとすらん</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-325-363"><seg source="#source-325-363">ふたつなきいのちをかくて</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-363-400"><seg source="#source-363-400">愚かにもうしなひつるよ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-400-432"><seg source="#source-400-432">秋の日の高きにたちて</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-432-472"><seg source="#source-432-472">こしかたをおもへばかなし</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-472-507"><seg source="#source-472-507">すぎし日の憂ひならねば</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-507-544"><seg source="#source-507-544">あまからぬこの歎きかな</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-544-558"><seg source="#source-544-558">見よ彼方</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-558-574"><seg source="#source-558-574">日は眞晝</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-574-606"><seg source="#source-574-606">藍ふかき海のはるかに</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-606-637"><seg source="#source-606-637">眞白なる鴎どりはも</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-637-669"><seg source="#source-637-669">一羽ゐてなに思ふらん</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-669-706"><seg source="#source-669-706">波の穗にうかびただよふ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-706-741"><seg source="#source-706-741">願はくばわが老いらくの</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-741-781"><seg source="#source-741-781">日もかかれ　世の外にして</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-781-813"><seg source="#source-781-813">つたなかる心ひとつを</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-813-850"><seg source="#source-813-850">いだきつつわが來し旅の</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-850-888"><seg source="#source-850-888">ゆくすゑをいゆきたどらん</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-888-919"><seg source="#source-888-919">よしやえし西も東も</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-919-954"><seg source="#source-919-954">今はとてかへるすべなき</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-954-991"><seg source="#source-954-991">これはこれ旅にしあれば</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-991-1026"><seg source="#source-991-1026">相模野の野のすゑつかた</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1026-1066"><seg source="#source-1026-1066">おしなべてものはおとろへ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1066-1104"><seg source="#source-1066-1104">われひとりかくつぶやくに</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1104-1158"><seg source="#source-1104-1113">風高し</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1113-1134"><rb>端山</rb><rt>はやま</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1134-1158"><rb>艸山</rb><rt>くさやま</rt></ruby></p>
    </body>
